In the afternoon I work a lot.
I write code.
We also have two short meetings.
At five o'clock I finish work.
I shut down my laptop.
Then I pack my backpack.
I put on my jacket.
Jonas is still sitting at his desk.
"Are you going home now?" asks Jonas.
"Yes, I am leaving now," I answer.
"Have a nice evening!" he says.
"Thanks, you too!"
"See you tomorrow," I say.
I leave the office.
I go outside.
It is already dark.
Now I go shopping.
